# 换行符规则：仓库内统一存 LF，工作区也检出 LF。
# 目的：消除 Windows 与 Linux 之间的整文件差异，并去掉 "LF will be replaced by CRLF" 提示。
# 规则说明见 代码/docs/Git协作规范.md。不要用其他方式单独改某个文件的换行符。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换，也不参与文本 diff
*.docx  binary
*.doc   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.7z    binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.bmp   binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary